<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>summer days</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">8percent</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Savage Ga$p</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">summer days</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3xyDwFXqqxADFTDByLgKxJ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Brooklyn Isley Rhoads"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Gaspare Maggadino"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Brooklyn Rhoads"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Evan Khalenberg"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Joumell Dingal"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">一人 秋の海をみつめて思い出す</p><p ttm:agent="v1">あの夏の影を探して</p><p ttm:agent="v1">\$upreme, you're a bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 8percent, Savage Ga\$p]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' back to the summer days under the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Only time I felt alive is with you by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you don't gotta run, but you know you are the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let me wipe away yo' tears 'cause I hate when you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I'm flexed up, racks up, know they hate me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm next up, that's the talk around the town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but lately I've been missin' you, watchu wanna get into?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that I shouldn't, but I admit, you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' back to the summer days under the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Only time I felt alive is with you by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you don't gotta run, but you know you arе the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let mе wipe away yo' tears 'cause I hate when you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I'm flexed up, racks up, know they hate me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm next up, that's the talk around the town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but lately I've been missin' you, watchu wanna get into?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that I shouldn't, but (Yeah, uhm) I admit, you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Savage Ga\$p]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, like, I said, "Moshi, Moshi," nah, I'm playin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna live them summer days with you again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When you hit me every morning, when you be like, "What's the plan?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When you said I couldn't do it, you would tell me that I can</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like, damn, I just had to go and get my mind right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you still the one, I guess I'll see you when the time's right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Life is just a game and I swear you were just the highlights</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you tryna ****, I'm sure we could get vibes right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Loves like Snorlax, [?] like [?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Witnessed love at first sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that if it just be me and you, everything is beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you wanna send them, well, I guess this is yo' interview</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shit got ****ed up, life just got crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That don't mean that you not my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Take it back to summertime, I'd do it a hundred times</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Said you got a new man, now I'm like, "**** you, right"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 8percent]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' back to the summer days under the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Only time I felt alive is with you by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you don't gotta run, but you know you are the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let me wipe away yo' tears 'cause I hate when you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I'm flexed up, racks up, know they hate me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm next up, that's the talk around the town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but lately I've been missin' you, watchu wanna get into?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that I shouldn't, but I admit, you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' back to the summer days under the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Only time I felt alive is with you by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you don't gotta run, but you know you are the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let me wipe away yo' tears 'cause I hate when you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I'm flexed up, racks up, know they hate me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm next up, that's the talk around the town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, but lately I've been missin' you, watchu wanna get into?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that I shouldn't, but I admit, you got me thinkin' back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">忘れられないけど次の夏にも またここへ来る</p></div></body></tt>